      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} Hii!\n\nYes this still happens, I just reproduced it on the build linked above and made a video.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/Rt_BTIz_UZA\n\nI join the world and immediately start playing videos over and over as quickly as I can to make sure the two AVPro instances load a video simultaneously. Resulting in a crash to desktop.",
